# Data files: mostly large and/or fully reproducible by running the
# pipeline/ scripts in order (see "Member B's tasks.md"), so not worth
# tracking. Exception: the DFFH rent report is a dated quarterly snapshot
# (filename is quarter-specific) that would silently differ if re-fetched
# later, and it's small + CC BY 4.0 licensed — so it's the one raw file we
# keep in the repo.
data/*
!data/moving_annual_rent_by_suburb.xlsx
